      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define loan amounts and terms\n    home_price = 500_000\n    first_principal = home_price * 0.80\n    second_principal = home_price * 0.10\n\n    # Calculate monthly principal-and-interest payments\n    first_rate = 0.035 / 12\n    first_months = 30 * 12\n    first_payment = first_principal * first_rate / (1 - (1 + first_rate) ** -first_months)\n\n    second_rate = 0.06 / 12\n    second_months = 15 * 12\n    second_payment = second_principal * second_rate / (1 - (1 + second_rate) ** -second_months)\n\n    # Return the combined payment, rounded to the nearest dollar\n    return round(first_payment + second_payment)\n```",
